sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as Glue reconciler
    participant WH as Bucharest warehouse
    participant S as Electronic Market
    participant E as eMAG

    Note over R: at startup, every 10 s, after each allocation or cancel, on stock.adjusted
    R->>WH: GET /stock
    WH-->>R: on_hand and reserved per product
    R->>R: sellable = max(0, on_hand - reserved), minus any stock buffer
    R->>S: set stock, one call per product
    R->>E: product_offer/save, one batch of 6 products
    E-->>R: 5 applied, MBA-M4 rejected
    R->>R: MBA-M4 on eMAG marked dirty, stock_push_failed
    Note over R,E: the next run pushes every product again, changed or not
    R->>E: product_offer/save batch
    E-->>R: all applied, dirty flag cleared
